 "attribution": "Data from 17Lands (https://www.17lands.com), public datasets. The deck pools these values were fitted on were drafted by bots whose picks used 17Lands FDN games-in-hand win rates (draft/limited/pickbot/ratings/FDN.json), so the values are derived from 17Lands data. Changes: per-card values fitted from simulated games, rescaled at load.",
 "source": "Generation 2 of an iterated refit: a ridge-logistic model of the game result (first deck wins) on the difference between the two decks' card counts, ridge strength 1e-4 times the game count, dv = 0.55 + 0.25 times the card's coefficient, fitted on 227,000 self-play games of bot-drafted FDN decks played by the dirac engine with the heuristic bot on both seats, 2026-11-05. n is the number of fitted games in which the two decks held different numbers of the card.",
 "provenance": "Used by the champion persona with colour fit 8, signal weight 2 and colour bias G+3, B-2, R-2. Measured 2026-11-06 on the dirac engine with the heuristic bot piloting both seats: 500 eight-seat pods, each kept deck playing eight of 3,150 held-out 17Lands FDN decks in both seat orders. Champion 64.5% [63.7, 65.2] (n 18,055 games) against 43.9% [43.0, 44.9] (n 19,851) for the default rating-colour and best23 persona. Caveats: dirac engine and heuristic bot pilot, not the gorge engine; decks with a card dirac refuses to play were dropped, which biases the result in an unknown direction; pods had eight seats where hosted events have four; the values are conditional on that pilot and shift when it changes. Cards absent from this table are rated as the 17Lands mean.",
